      "text": "⚡ Redis 7 (Cache & PubSub)\n\nKeys & Patterns:\n• pubsub:channel:{ch_id}\n• presence:user:{user_id} (60s)\n• presence:ws:{id}:online (Set)\n• cache:user:{id} (300s)\n• cache:channel:{id} (600s)\n• ratelimit:ws:{user_id}\n\n🔒 Internal Port: 6379",
